// AGENCY OST — 12 · Rogue Process
// ACT II. The escaped process forks itself faster than it can be killed.
// Perturbator club-mode: four-on-floor, 16th chug under a stop-riff, big
// arps — and every 8th bar the whole mix slam-stops on the back half
// (the turnaround), leaving only the reverb.
//
// FORM (122 BPM · 1 cycle = 1 bar · 64 bars ≈ 2:06 · loops):
//   intro   8  e2  filtered chug fades up + arp; a process wakes
//   fork    16 e4  full club: 4-floor, offbeat hats, stop-riff bass, arp
//   swarm   16 e5  + screaming lead trading with the arp
//   kill    8  e2  killed? — half-time, riff ghosts, pad only
//   fork2   8  e5  it re-forks: everything, filter wide open
//   outro   8  e1  processes wink out one by one
// hook: the turnaround slam-stop — every 8th bar, all sections but kill.

setbpm(122);

"<intro@2 fork@4 swarm@4 kill@2 fork2@2 outro@2>".slow(4).pickRestart({
  intro: stack(
    note("f#1*16").s("supersaw")
